  },
  "scope_notes": "Stacked on open PR #36895 and includes that PR's commits in the diff. Includes synthetic block deserialization benchmarks and script witness fuzz tests.",
  "changed_since_previous": "Rebased without substantive changes to the approach or commit structure.",
  "card": "This draft PR adds performance optimizations on top of PR 36895's serialized witness stack storage. It streams serialized witness stacks directly into raw byte storage during deserialization, inlines CompactSize parsing for 5-7x faster iteration, stores the last element offset for O(1) back() access, and defers witness-to-vector conversion during script verification until rules actually evaluate the witness. Author benchmarks show validation time for synthetic blocks packed with millions of tiny witness items drops by up to 9x (128ms to 14ms). Depends on #36895.",
